      "title": "CASE WHEN 分类",
      "learningObjective": "能够运用本节知识完成：生成库存状态标签",
      "prerequisites": [
        "ch08"
      ],
      "concept": "按顺序检查 WHEN，返回首个为真的分支；ELSE 提供默认结果。",
      "syntax": "CASE WHEN condition THEN value ELSE other END",
      "parameters": {
